    including portions thereof.

1.4. "Executable Form"
    means any form of the work other than Source Code Form.

1.5. "Larger Work"
    means a work that combines Covered Software with other software or
    devices other than the Larger Work. A Larger Work is not a Covered
    Software.

1.6. "License"
    means this document.

1.7. "Licensable"
    means having the right to grant, to the maximum extent possible,
    whether at the time of the initial grant or subsequently, any and
    all of the rights conveyed by this License.

1.8. "Modifications"
    means any of the following: (a) any file in Source Code Form that
    results from an addition to, deletion from, or modification of the
    contents of Covered Software; or (b) any new file in Source Code
    Form that contains any part of the Covered Software.

1.9. "Patent Claims"
    means any patent claim(s), now owned or hereafter acquired, in any
    patent that is presently owned or in the future acquired by a
    Contributor, that would be infringed (directly, indirectly, or
    otherwise) by some or all of the Contributor Version, but do not
    include a claim that would be infringed only as a consequence of
    further modification of the Contributor Version.

1.10. "Source Code Form"
    means the form of a work preferred for making modifications,
    including (a) its source code, (b) the components that compose the
    work, and (c) the identification of the initial source code file
    to which the modifications are made.

1.11. "You"
    (or "Your") means an individual or a legal entity exercising rights
    under this License.

